 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "<p>The local animal shelter is having another vote-by-donation charity event! This time, for a $10 donation, an individual can complete a ranked ballot indicating their favorite small dog breed, miniature, from the ones provided: miniature poodle, Yorkshire terrier, or Chihuahua. Use the summary of ballots below to answer each question.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Votes</th>\n<th>53</th>\n<th>42</th>\n<th>24</th>\n<th>11</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>(P) Miniature Poodle</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td></tr>\n<tr><td>(Y) Yorkshire Terrier</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>(C) Chihuahua</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 545011,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Determine the winner of the election by the ranked-choice method.\n",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The total number of votes: 130.</p>\n<p>50 percent of 130 is 65.</p>\n<p>To win the majority, you need at least one more than 65, which is 66.</p>\n<p>First Round:</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Votes</th>\n<th>53</th>\n<th>42</th>\n<th>24</th>\n<th>11</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>(M) Miniature Poodle</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>(Y) Yorkshire Terrier</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>(C) Chihuahua</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Miniature Poodle: 53</p>\n<p>Yorkshire Terrier: 24 + 11 = 35</p>\n<p>Chihuahua: 42</p>\n<p>No one has 66, so eliminate the Yorkshire Terrier.</p>\n<p>Second Round:</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Votes</th>\n<th>53</th>\n<th>42</th>\n<th>24</th>\n<th>11</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>(M) Miniature Poodle</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>(C) Chihuahua</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Miniature Poodle: 53 + 11 = 64</p>\n<p>Chihuahua: 42 + 24 = 66</p>\n<p>The Chihuahua wins.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Chihuahua."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 545012,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Determine the winner of the election if poodles are removed from the ballot.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The total number of votes: 130.</p>\n<p>50 percent of 130 is 65.</p>\n<p>To win the majority, you need at least one more than 65, which is 66.</p>\n<p>First Round:</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Votes</th>\n<th>53</th>\n<th>42</th>\n<th>24</th>\n<th>11</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>(Y) Yorkshire Terrier</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>(C) Chihuahua</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Yorkshire Terrier: 53 + 24 + 11 = 88</p>\n<p>Chihuahua: 42</p>\n<p>The Yorkshire Terrier wins.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Yorkshire Terrier."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 545013,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Does this election violate IIA?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "Yes, this violates IIA, or Independence of Irrelevant Alternatives Criterion. This means that the introduction or removal of a third candidate should not change or reverse the rankings of the original two candidates relative to one another. In particular, if a losing candidate is removed from a race or a new candidate is added, the winner should not change."
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Yes, this election violates IIA."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
